`show bgp neighbor | display json`).

Each recipe or probe that carries upstream output has a `# Capture:` block
naming the source, the commit and the exact upstream file, and CI checks the
captured output against that file at that commit.

None of the output taken from upstream has been verified against hardware by
this project, which is why the recipes and probes that read it declare no
`verified:`.
